+### 15.5 Data Flow: Fragment Injection Path (Verified from aampgstplayer.cpp line 830-920)
+
+```mermaid
+sequenceDiagram
+    participant Collector as StreamAbstractionAAMP_HLS/MPD
+    participant GST as AAMPGstPlayer
