+    IRDK-&gt;&gt;IRDK: IdleTaskAdd(IdleCallback)
+    IRDK-&gt;&gt;IRDK: TimerAdd(ProgressCallbackOnTimeout)
+
+    Note over APP,HW: ═══ STEADY STATE ═══
+
+    loop Every progressInterval ms
+        IRDK-&gt;&gt;IRDK: MonitorAV (query positions, detect stall/freeze/avsync)
