+### Key CC Concepts:
+
+| Type | Description | Data Source | Rendering Path |
+|------|-------------|------------|----------------|
+| **Inband CC** | CEA-608/708 embedded in video ES | Decoder extracts from video PES | `closedCaptionDataCb` -> `CCDataController` -> `ClosedCaptionsPacket` -> `SubtecChannel` |
